ck scorecards online. The result includes qualifying status and marks obtained in the examination. Candidates need an application number and date of birth to access the result. Read below to know more about DRDO CEPTAM 11 Result 2026 download link, steps to check, scorecard, next stage of selection and more.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://testbook.com/drdo-ceptam/syllabus-exam-pattern\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"tb-auto-button\">DRDO CEPTAM 11 Tier 2 Syllabus 2026: Click to Download</a></strong></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-9\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n<div style=\"\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  justify-content:space-between;\n  gap:16px;\n  background:#fff9f4;\n  border:1px solid #f3c9b8;\n  border-radius:16px;\n  padding:16px 20px;\n  margin:22px 0;\n  flex-wrap:wrap;\n\">\n\n  <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; flex:1;\">\n    <img src=\"https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Google.webp\" alt=\"Google\" style=\"width:32px; height:auto;\">\n\n    <div style=\"line-height:1.35;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#111;\">\n        Add Testbook as Preferred Source on Google\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <a href=\"https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=testbook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" style=\"\n      background:#ea4335;\n      color:#fff;\n      padding:10px 22px;\n      border-radius:22px;\n      font-size:15px;\n      font-weight:700;\n      text-decoration:none;\n      white-space:nowrap;\n    \">\n    Add Preference\n  </a>\n\n</div></div>\n\n<h2>DRDO CEPTAM 11 Result 2026 Out</h2>\n<p>DRDO CEPTAM 11 Result 2026 has been announced on the official website. Candidates who appeared for Tier 1 exam can now check results online. It includes marks and qualifying status for Technician A &amp; Senior Technician Assistant B post. Candidates can access results by using their application number and date of birth. Qualified candidates will appear for the next stage i.e., CBT 2. The <strong>DRDO CEPTAM 11 Tier 2 Exam 2026 will be held on 15th June 2026</strong>.</p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-56236 size-full\" src=\"https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DRDO-CEPTAM-11-Tier-2-Exam-Date.jpg\" alt=\"DRDO CEPTAM 11 Tier 2 Exam Date\" width=\"700\" height=\"572\" srcset=\"https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DRDO-CEPTAM-11-Tier-2-Exam-Date.jpg 700w, https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DRDO-CEPTAM-11-Tier-2-Exam-Date-300x245.jpg 300w, https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DRDO-CEPTAM-11-Tier-2-Exam-Date-150x123.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\"></p>\n<h2>DRDO CEPTAM 11 Result at drdo.gov.in</h2>\n<p>Candidates who appeared for Tier 1 exam can now check their results online. The result contain marks obtained and qualifying status for the next stage of recruitment. Candidates can refer to the table below for important information related to recruitment process.</p>\n<table style=\"width: 45.4932%;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 98.72%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>DRDO CEPTAM 11 Result 2026</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.549%;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Organization Name</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.171%;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Defence Research &amp; Development Organisation (DRDO)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.549%;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Post Name</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.171%;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Technician-A and Senior Technical Assistant-B</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.549%;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Vacancies</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.171%;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">764</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.549%;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mode of Result</span></td>\n<td s