fficial website</p>\n<p><strong>Q3. What login details are required to download the DRDO CEPTAM 11 Merit List?</strong></p>\n<p>Candidates should have application number &amp; date of birth to check DRDO CEPTAM 11 Result</p>\n<p><strong>Q4. What details are mentioned on DRDO CEPTAM 11 Result?</strong></p>\n<p>It contains marks obtained and qualifying status for next stage</p>\n<p><strong>Q5. What is the next stage after DRDO CEPTAM 11 Tier 1 Result?</strong></p>\n<p>Qualified candidates will appear for CBT 2 exam. Technician A candidates will also have to appear for trade or skill test</p>\n<div class=\"saboxplugin-wrap\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\" itemscope=\"\" itemprop=\"author\"><div class=\"saboxplugin-tab\"><div class=\"saboxplugin-gravatar\"></div><div class=\"saboxplugin-authorname\"><a href=\"https://testbook.com/news/author/trishala-singh/\" class=\"vcard author\" rel=\"author\"><span class=\"fn\">Trishala Singh</span></a></div><div class=\"saboxplugin-desc\"><div itemprop=\"description\"><p>Trishala has over 5 years of experience in the education sector, specializing in competitive examinations and government recruitment. She creates well-researched articles on exam-related updates and preparation guidance. Her goal is to deliver accurate, timely and easy-to-understand information that helps aspirants stay informed and well prepared throughout their exam journey.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div></div><div class=\"code-block code-block-6\" style=\"margin: 8px auto; text-align: center; display: block; clear: both;\">\n\n</div>\n<!-- CONTENT END 1 -->\n        </div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\n        <!-- .entry-footer -->\n    </div>\n",
